WEBVTT

00:27:28.017 --> 00:27:31.437
That's why in designing
an effective market,

00:27:31.479 --> 00:27:33.606
we have to start with integrity.

00:27:34.065 --> 00:27:38.653
These core carbon principles,
which we call CCPs,

00:27:38.695 --> 00:27:42.407
will address the most critical
elements of credit quality.

00:27:43.241 --> 00:27:46.035
They include additionality,

00:27:46.035 --> 00:27:49.997
permanence, robust quantification,

00:27:49.997 --> 00:27:52.917
validation and verification,

00:27:52.917 --> 00:27:55.128
no double-counting,

00:27:55.169 --> 00:27:58.131
transition to net zero emissions

00:27:58.131 --> 00:28:03.219
and sustainable development
impacts and safeguards.